<title>FRANCE: Moroccan firm buys 30,000 tonnes wheat.</title>
<headline>Moroccan firm buys 30,000 tonnes wheat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A private Moroccan firm on Thursday bought 30,000 tonnes of optional-origin soft wheat at $149.50 per tonne including freight, European traders said.</p>
<p>The wheat is for delivery by July 25, they said.</p>
</text>
